  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Exact stocks </h3> <h1> Add-on »z.Stock« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS with the <strong>add-on »z.Stock«</strong> ensures clear transparency in the tool warehouse: The 3D‑storage location management system displays all stocks accurately, while the inventory control feature makes availability and usage locations visible at all times. Suppliers, prices, and order quantities are managed centrally, order proposals are generated automatically and orders are sent via email. Incoming tools are digitally entered and inspected. All tool data, storage locations and stocks are immediately accessible at – for efficient, secure, and fully digital tool management.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/a/csm_zStock_product_60e02db310.webp",
