  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Add-on »z.Stock« </h3> <h2> Planning certainty </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The add-on ensures complete transparency from the goods receipt through to their use – the foundation for fact-based purchasing. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add-on provides real-time‑stock updates for maximum reliability and helps avoid downtime. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add-on enables the traceability of every tool for targeted consumption analysis.</p>",
